window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The four Courts that make up the Realms of Fundamental Magic have been split for thousands of years with no communication, and no help from one another. When the leaders of each Court gathered their people and made a new home in their new lands they forgot one very important detail. The elemental power each Court holds could help the entire realm in more ways than one.</p> <p>There have been three assassination attempts on the “Cursed” Queen Alinta in a month. When she and her mate King Logi try to figure out who is responsible for these attacks more things start happening that they can't explain. Things start getting out of hand they figure out they can't handle this by themselves and it might be time to try to make an ally of another court in the realm.</p>"; 
